Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:58:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/30] v3d: V3D 3.3 compiler and driver fixes 1-19

The fixes for code paths only V3D 3.3 takes, each found on the KSTB6077 by
a crash, a hang or a wrong picture (linux/README.md "GPU", fixes 1-19),
and GLES BGRA renderbuffer/BGRA8_EXT acceptance.
